# voi2 population: MC set 400 questions / 8033 nodes; preposterior set 3000 questions / 60702 nodes; K 3-8

## MC noise ceiling (split-half per-question Spearman, Spearman-Brown corrected)
- MC_log: split-half 0.858 -> full-sample reliability ≈ 0.923
- MC_P: split-half 0.956 -> full-sample reliability ≈ 0.978
- MC_01: split-half 0.958 -> full-sample reliability ≈ 0.978
- MC_brier: split-half 0.845 -> full-sample reliability ≈ 0.916

MC ref sanity: fraction of nodes with negative expected gain: MC_log 0.30, MC_P 0.40, MC_01 0.01, MC_brier 0.32

